# Edit home (Pavilion-first)

**Shared product** (visitor, member portal, staff) is authored in **`~/pavilion`**.  
www.shmspto.org is **customer #1** — dedicated deploy from **`~/shmspto`**, updated by promote.

## Where to edit

| Surface | Edit in |
|---------|---------|
| Shared product (site / portal / staff) | **`~/pavilion`** (this repo) |
| Demo / brand packs / trial CRM / marketing | **`~/pavilion`** |
| SHMS-only ops (Wix CMS, school env, production hotfix) | **`~/shmspto`** |

### Wix = SHMS only (critical)

**Wix CMS / Wix Data / Wix Stores live credentials are for VIP customer SHMS only.** Pavilion product and other tenants do not use Wix.

| Work | Commit / ship |
|------|----------------|
| Shared product that must stay Wix-free (or connector-agnostic) | **`~/pavilion`** |
| Anything that reads/writes **Wix collections**, Staff queues over Wix CMS, SiteSettings via Wix, Wix Stores for SHMS catalog | **`~/shmspto` only** — do **not** commit that to pavilion |

Examples that stay on **shmspto**: volunteer/contact form CMS queues, live Volunteers / ContactSubmissions Staff lists, SHMS inbox addresses (`@shmspto.org`), Wix CMS field ensures.

Pushing `pavilion` `main` does **not** update www. Promoting + shipping SHMS does — **avoid casual promotes during school hours.**

## Promote to Stone Hill (intentional)

```bash
node scripts/promote-to-shms.mjs
# then ~/shmspto → node scripts/ship-stone-hill.mjs
```

## Hotfix discipline

If you must fix www first: edit `~/shmspto` → `ship-stone-hill.mjs` → **same day** port into pavilion with `--from-shms` (emergency only).

## Anti-patterns (forbidden)

- Treating `~/shmspto` as the place to build new shared product
- Committing **Wix CMS / Wix Data Staff queues** or SHMS-only inbox hardcodes into **`~/pavilion`**
- Auto-promoting to SHMS after every demo ship
- `vercel link` / deploy Stone Hill from this monorepo
- Calling Stone Hill “shipped” after only pushing pavilion
